::T|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.043|    SubscribedContent-338389Enabled=0 :
::T|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.044|        Coupe les notifications de conseils et suggestions. Uniquement des
::T|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.045|        notifications, aucun gain mesurable.
::T|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.046|    SubscribedContent-338393Enabled=0 :
