::X|FR|storagesense.cadence.015|  Cible           : HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Storage
::X|FR|storagesense.cadence.016|                    Sense\Parameters\StoragePolicy /v "2048" /t REG_DWORD
