::X|FR|mo.gamedvr.off.031|  Cible           : reg add HKEY_CURRENT_USER\System\GameConfigStore /v
::X|FR|mo.gamedvr.off.032|                    GameDVR_Enabled /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f and reg add HKEY_
